:: T: VehVeh Schooling [topic] {"position":"6400,1650","size":"100,100"}
{=

(storylet: when
(passage:) contains "NPC"
and $char's VehVeh's opinion's 2nd > 20
and $char's VehVeh's location is "Apesai Lighthouse"
and $char's player's timerCooldown does not contain "T: VehVeh Schooling"
)

(metadata:
"NPC", "VehVeh",
"title", "Asking Veh-Veh About Her Apprenticeship",
"topic", [{
	(if: ($funcTalkedTimesCheck: "schoolingApesai") < 1)[	"How's being an apprentice here in Apesai?"]
	(else:)["I want to talk more about your education. What are you working on?"]
}],
"topicDetail", "Apesai - and the whole of Askava, for that matter - isn't exactly known for its magical education. Still, for an apprentice, that might as well be their whole world.",
"cooldown", 1,
"talked", (a: "schoolingApesai", "absentPrincipal", "studentLab",),
"addCode", [{
	(if: ($funcTalkedTimesCheck: "schoolingApesai") <= 3)[
    	($funcOpinionGainLoss: "VehVeh", 1, "Veh-Veh brightens up when she talks about her studies.")
        ]
}],
)

$cssColumnParent[

$cssColumnChild[
	$cssBox[
    	($funcImage: (passage: "S: VehVeh")'s img)
         $cssBoxItem[''(print: (passage:)'s title )''<br>(print: (passage:)'s topicDetail)]
    ]
]

$cssColumnChild[

$cssDesc[''You: //(print: (passage:)'s topic)//'']
<br>

<!--default busy-->
(set: _busyText to "Veh-Veh seems like she has more to say on the matter, but she's done talking for the day.")
<!--default goodbye-->
(set: _goodbyeText to "\"Glad to have talked to a fellow student, Veh-Veh. Bye.\"")

<!--first time-->
(if: ($funcTalkedTimesCheck: "schoolingApesai") < 1)[{

["Are you asking about the apprenticeship program in general?"]<VehVehLine| She says, beaming. ["Or are you asking about mine, specifically?"]
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"You, specifically.\"", "youSpecifically",
	"<!--B-->\"In general, I mean.\"", "inGeneral",
))
<br>

<!--youSpecifically-->
[
["Oh, well, I'm hardly the representative case,"]<VehVehLine| she adjusts the star on her cap. ["//Technically//, I'm still an apprentice. A senior. Probably the oldest one here, though one can't tell with the native students, since not everyone has their papers or knows their birth year. I've already passed the imperial exams though. Early too."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"Impressive.\"", "impressive",
	"<!--B-->\"But why are you still an apprentice?\"", "whyApprentice",
))
<br>
](youSpecifically|

<!--impressive-->
[
["Hehe, thank you."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"But why are you still an apprentice?\"", "whyApprentice",
))
<br>
](impressive|

<!--inGeneral-->
[
["There's a six-year universal program, mostly for the boarding children and the occasional non-magical professionals - merchants, engineers, and provincial clerks, anyone with the time and money,"]<VehVehLine| she explains. Sounds about the same where you're from. ["And after that, for whoever remains, there's another six-year specialist program. Which I'm //still// in, even though I've already passed the imperial exams."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"Still? Why haven't they let you journey yet?\"", "whyApprentice",
))
<br>
](inGeneral|

<!--whyApprentice-->
[
["I'm sure you know, but exams are only one requirement. The local davehkhan council - my teachers - decide the rest. I'm in my 'practicum period', they call it. Work-study assistantship. Added a capstone requirement on top of it too. The principal said he'd be my mentor, but then he went on leave. So, that's where I'm at. Not sure what's next."]<VehVehLine| she clicks her tongue.
<br>
How strange, these far provinces are. The moment you passed your exams, you were immediately eligible to journey. Only, you had no say in //where// you'd journey. Whereas you had only one option, Veh-Veh has none. 
<br>
["It's not that bad, truly,"]<VehVehLine| she quickly changes course. ["I have everything I need here: a laboratory, library, my own room with a view of the sea, my own telescope, a clean dining hall - though I prefer to eat in the garden - and oh, of course, the garden. Not everything is top-of-the-line, well maybe except the view, but the davehmars here //have// tried to cover everything."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"That sounds wonderful. You'll miss all of this if you journey.\"", "missAll",
	"<!--B-->\"Are you sure journeying is for you? You'll have to rough it out there.\"", "roughingIt",
))
<br>
](whyApprentice|

<!--missAll-->
[
As you say this, you realize that you, too, miss the comforts of university life as well. Of //civilization//. The wild sun of Askava is not kind to anyone, especially an outsider like yourself.
<br>
["I suppose I //will// miss this. Never knew much else,"]<VehVehLine| Veh-Veh says, wistfully. ["But what's the point of schooling if you're not going to finish it, right? Can't be a kid forever."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"Plenty of magi never become masters.\"", "neverMaster",
	"<!--B-->\"You're right. No point at all.\"", "noPoint",
))
<br>
](missAll|

<!--roughingIt-->
[
["Ha, //you// would know, I don't doubt it,"]<VehVehLine| Veh-Veh chuckles, a hint of bitterness. ["But how rougher can it get? I know that Askava isn't anything like the heartlands; it's barely Nurandahid. All the more reason for me to want to journey."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
Makes sense. To be a true magus, one needs practical immersion. Being immersed in these wild, arid lands means desiccation. Your assignment to Askava was, for all intents and purposes, career assassination.
<br>
["Plus, I've already spent twelve - no, thirteen - years of my life for this,"]<VehVehLine| she adds. ["What's the point of schooling if you're not going to finish it, right? Can't be a kid forever."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"Plenty of magi never become a master.\"", "neverMaster",
	"<!--B-->\"You're right. No point at all.\"", "noPoint",
))
<br>
](roughingIt|


<!--neverMaster-->
[
Failed magi still find employment, usually as neighborhood teachers or maintenance workers. Others turn to parlour tricks and back-alley medicine. People don't call these types "magi", though.
<br>
["No, you're right,"]<VehVehLine| she says. There is a bitterness in that smile. ["But that's their business. I //do// plan on being a master."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"Got it.\"", "gotIt",
))
<br>
](neverMaster|


<!--noPoint-->
[
["Yep. thaaat's right!"]<VehVehLine| She says, more to herself than anything. ["No. point. at. all."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"Yeah.\"", "gotIt",
))
<br>
](noPoint|

<!--gotIt-->
[
Sensing a lull in the conversation, Veh-Veh snaps back to life, ["Ah, forget it. I'm complaining again. Let's pick this back up another time. You asked about my apprenticeship, but I haven't even told you about what I'm researching."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"You can just tell me now.\"", "tellNow",
	"<!--B-->\"Alright, another time it is.\"", "anotherTime",
))
<br>
](gotIt|

[
["Nah,"]<VehVehLine| she waves her hands, suddenly bashful. ["Next time."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"Alright, I'll respect that.\"", "anotherTime",
))
<br>
](tellNow|

<!--anotherTime-->
[
(if: $char's VehVeh's energy's 1st > 0)[["I just don't want to talk your ears off about my own business. You probably have other things you wanted to discuss. If so, go ahead."]<VehVehLine|(set: _goodbyeText to "\"That's alright. Glad to have talked to a fellow student, Veh-Veh. Bye.\"")]
(else:)[["Yeah. Oh, speaking of research,"]<VehVehLine| she takes our her notebook, suddenly remembering something she has to do, which is a lot, judging by how packed the pages are. ["Sorry, I..."]<VehVehLine|(set: _goodbyeText to "\"It's alright. I've taken up enough of your time. Next time, Veh-Veh.\"")]
<br>
(show: ?done)
](anotherTime|

}]<!--end first time-->


<!--second time-->
(elseif: ($funcTalkedTimesCheck: "schoolingApesai") < 2)[{

The two of you talked briefly about her education in Apesai before but got lost in the weeds before getting to anything of substance.
<br>
["Oh that's right, my capstone research!"]<VehVehLine| Veh-Veh lights up, but just as quickly, the light fades. ["I... I shouldn't be talking about plans that are going nowhere."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"Why not? I thought you wanted to discuss it.\"", "whyNot",
	"<!--B-->\"Trust me, from one scholar to another: Talking about it helps.\"", "talkingHelps",
	"<!--C-->\"So what //can// you talk about?\"", "canTalk",
))
<br>

<!--whyNot-->
[
["It's embarrassing. My enthusiasm gets ahead of me sometimes,"]<VehVehLine| she sighs. ["But well, I brought it up before. Suppose it wouldn't hurt."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"I'm all ears.\"", "allEars",
))
<br>
](whyNot|

<!--talkingHelps-->
[
["But then if I talk about it too much, I might lose all motivation to keep going,"]<VehVehLine| she sighs. ["But well, I brought it up before. Suppose I can talk //moderately// about it."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"I'm all ears.\"", "allEars",
))
<br>
](talkingHelps|

<!--canTalk-->
[
["I can tell about my specialization. Then again... I'll have to talk about the //what// and //why// of it,"]<VehVehLine| she sighs. ["Oh well, I brought it up before. No use avoiding it. Forgive me if there are gaps in my knowledge, alright?"]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"Alright.\"", "allEars",
))
<br>
](canTalk|

<!--allEars-->
[
["Do you see the children around you?"]<VehVehLine|
<br>
<!--continue link-->
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"I do.\"", "iDo",
	"<!--B-->\"Hard not to.\"", "iDo",
	"<!--C-->\"What about them?\"", "iDo",
))
<br>
](allEars|

<!--iDo-->
[It has been quite difficult not to notice the running, screaming, laughing junior apprentices around you. Some stop only momentarily stick out their tongues at Veh-Veh. Most of them have strikingly fair hair, from dirty-straw to silvery-white, and copper-red skin.
<br>
["Many teachers think they are a 'lost cause'. Whenever there's a faculty meeting, at least one teacher will bring up how we ought to suspend our recruitment drives since the school cannot afford to 'babysit' the natives' children, and most 'don't come to fruition'. I fill in as the recorder whenever the attendants are broken, so I've heard a lot of such talk,"]<VehVehLine| she sighs.
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"It's not the children's fault that their betters cannot adequately serve them.\"", "notFault",
	"<!--B-->\"Do you not think your teachers have a point? A magus's training is not for everyone.\"", "notForEveryone",
	"<!--C-->\"The Apesai school is strained, and they can only save so many children.\"", "saveSoMany",
))
<br>
](iDo|

<!--notFault-->
[
["It's not anyone's fault, and not my teachers' fault either,"]<VehVehLine| she says, quite defensively. ["The sad reality is that there is only so many rial to go around, so many mouths to feed, to clothe, to shelter. I don't blame them if they want the best to receive the best, but I will blame them for not trying."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"\"I see...\"", "iSee",
))
<br>
](notFault|

<!--notForEveryone-->
[
["It's true, but for //whom//? The scions of nobility? They can afford tutors anyway. Why have a school out in the frontier if we're not giving the people here the best chance for a future? Just think about how many bright and promising Askavan children will lose out if we stop our recruitment drive. I know it's not the school's fault, but it shouldn't come to that."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"\"I suppose...\"", "iSee",
))
<br>
](notForEveryone|

<!--saveSoMany-->
[
["Yes, that is the pragmatic way of seeing things, and I agree. It's not the school's fault, but I cannot help but feel like we - and by that, I mean us imperials - are losing sight of our mission here. Aren't we supposed bring enlightenment? Stars are not so stingy with their light, so why must we? Is Askava not //a// dahak of the Greatest Empire to Ever Exist? I sympathize with having to be selective, but it's unthinkable to suspend the program altogether."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"\"I suppose...\"", "iSee",
))
<br>
](saveSoMany|

<!--iSee-->
[
In your university, only one in every five students makes it all the way through their twelve years. The remaining majority drop out to help out with their family business, or to serve their parents' courts, or to go on adventures. You can hardly imagine where these native children would go if they fail to graduate. Back to their villages out in the desert? Or to the Apesai streets?
<br>
Then, Veh-Veh turns to look at you and says, ["For my capstone project, I'd like to do something about the matter. For the children and the school, before I leave it."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"And what would that be?\"", "researchProject",
))
<br>
](iSee|

<!--researchProject-->
[
["A better way to detect talent. Better selection pool, so that the school can make the most out of its resources,"]<VehVehLine| she explains. ["I'm training to be an astrologian - a eudaimonian one. Divination has been used as a form of early aptitude screening in major universities. It's an obvious and necessary procedure."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
If you are not mistaken, divination had a role in your own admittance many years ago, although the administrators will never tell their students that.
<br>
<!--initialize $stuff's number-->
(set: $stuff to it + (dm: "number", 1))
<!--initialize convo options-->
(set: $stuff to it + (dm: "proposalQuestions", (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"Shouldn't the Apesai school already have something like that?\"", "alreadyHave" + (str:$stuff's number),
	"<!--B-->\"And what does this project entail?\"", "herPlan" + (str:$stuff's number),
	"<!--C-->\"Have you proposed this to the school council?\"", "proposeCouncil" + (str:$stuff's number),
	"<!--D-->\"Screenings, selections... Shouldn't a school with a civlizing mission be for all natives? This doesn't sound very inclusive.\"", "notInclusive" + (str:$stuff's number),
	"<!--E-->\"That's nice, Veh-Veh. I bid you good luck with that project.\"", "bidLuck",
)))
($funcInnerConvo: $stuff's proposalQuestions)
<br>

<!--code that eliminates an option and advance the hook name-->
(set: _editChoices to (macro: str-type _deleteWhich, [(out:)[{
	<!--advance 1 number-->
	(set: $stuff's number to it + 1)
	<!--edit destination number-->
	(for: each _question, ...(datanames: $stuff's proposalQuestions))[
		<!--edit-->
		(unless: $stuff's proposalQuestions's _question contains "bidLuck")[
			(set: $stuff's proposalQuestions to it + (dm: _question, (trimmed: digit, $stuff's proposalQuestions's _question)))
			(set: $stuff's proposalQuestions's _question to it + (str: $stuff's number))
		]
		<!--delete-->
		(if: $stuff's proposalQuestions's _question contains _deleteWhich)[(move: $stuff's proposalQuestions's _question into _trash)]
	]<!--end loop-->
	<!--update-->
    (set: $stuff's proposalQuestions to $stuff's proposalQuestions)
}]]))

(set: _talkHooks to (dm:
     "alreadyHave", "_alreadyHave",
     "herPlan", "_herPlan",
	 "proposeCouncil", "_proposeCouncil",
	 "notInclusive", "_notInclusive",
))

<!--create hooks-->
(for: each _round, ...(range: 1, (datanames: $stuff's proposalQuestions)'s length - 1) )[
     (for: each _talkChoice, ...(datanames: _talkHooks))[{
          (hidden:)+(hook: _talkChoice + (str:_round))[
          <!--perform edit-->
          (_editChoices: _talkChoice)
          <!--display text-->
          (print: _talkHooks's _talkChoice)
          ]<!--end hook-->
     }]
]

<!--alreadyHave-->
(set: _alreadyHave to [{
["We used to, according to the older faculties. But that was so long ago; I'm talking //Second-Colony// long. When Kesh took over Apesai, they stole a lot from the tower. Destroyed them, likely. We don't even have a record of the native clans. Everything must be built again from scratch. I think of it as me doing my part in the Reclamation."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: $stuff's proposalQuestions)
<br>
}])<!--end alreadyHave-->


<!--herPlan-->
(set: _herPlan to [{
["Oh, let's see... I should begin by building a genealogy of the clans of Askava - we need to know who is where first. And then, there's the matter of a local sky chart, including comets. All the imported stuff is out of date. And then... Oh, the more I talk about it, the more the list grows."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: $stuff's proposalQuestions)
<br>
}])<!--end herPlan-->


<!--proposeCouncil-->
(set: _proposeCouncil to [{
["I have. In fact, it was the principal - my mentor - who have put me onto this track. I only had a vague idea at first, but he thought it'd be best if I did this prior to journeying. Though he's no astrologer, school matters are very much //his// domain. It's only fitting that the assistant - me - picks up the work. One stone for two birds, I suppose. He also happened to be the chairman of the council, so no-one else challenged my proposal."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: $stuff's proposalQuestions)
<br>
}])<!--end proposeCouncil-->


<!--notInclusive-->
(set: _notInclusive to [{
["Oh, I know that,"]<VehVehLine| she says, crossing her arms. ["But the way I see it, the children needs a place that best fits them also. It is of little value to confine a child here if they would do better elsewhere. Plus, having a school here is already a gaint step in including the faraway peoples of Askava into Nurandah. We have to start somewhere, and that somewhere should be the very best first. It'll buy the school some time, recognition, and funding to be... charitable later."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: $stuff's proposalQuestions)
<br>
}])<!--end notInclusive-->

](researchProject|


<!--bidLuck-->
[
["Thank you,"]<VehVehLine| Veh-Veh chuckles. ["I'll need all the luck I can get. Who knows, maybe it'll be a good stepping stone into my journeying later... Although, I don't see how this stuff can end up producing a Sacred Opal. Some disciplines are just at a disadvantage, I suppose. Oh, I should stop worrying! I always get so far ahead of myself."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
She buries her face in her hands, clearly unable to stop thinking.
<br>
(if: $char's VehVeh's energy's 1st > 0)[["Maybe I shouldn't say much more until I've actually done something. Anyways, is there something //else// you wanted to talk about?"]<VehVehLine|]
(else:)[["Actually, I probably need to get back work too,"]<VehVehLine| she points a thumb at some indeterminate thing behind her. ["Haha, see? If I just talk, I won't actually //do// anything."]<VehVehLine|]
<!--clear $stuff-->
(set: $stuff to (dm:))
(set: _busyText to "Veh-Veh seems like she has more to say on the matter, but she's done talking for the day.")
(set: _goodbyeText to "\"For what it's worth, thanks for sharing, Veh-Veh. Goodbye.\"")
(show:?done)
<br>
](bidLuck|

}]<!--end of second time-->



<!--third time-->
(elseif: ($funcTalkedTimesCheck: "schoolingApesai") < 3)[{
["You keep asking me that. I image that it must be strange for you, to go from a full-fledged university to this no-where of a place."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
["To me, it's more about what you can make of yourself, and less what the place can do for you. It's a lesson one can't help but learn, living in Askava."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
["Oh, what am I talking about? Compared to the mainland, this island is a dream."]<VehVehLine|
<br>

}]<!--end third time-->


<!--fourth time-->
(else:)[{
["Heh, it's good that someone still cares about my education. But I think it'll be a better use of both our time if I get on with my studies instead of just talking about it."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
["Thank you, though. I'll be sure to let you know if I ever come across anything that could be of interest to you. Maybe we can compare notes? And if you finish your Sacred Opal, perhaps you'd write me a letter of recommendation?"]<VehVehLine|
<br>

''Remember to add special goodbyes:'' "Veh-Veh giggles and starts to collect her books.", "Sure. //If//. Goodbye, Veh-Veh."


}]<!--end fourth time-->



<!--done-->
[
---
<ol>
($funcNPCTopics: _busyText, _goodbyeText)
</ol>
](done|

]<!--end child-->
]<!--end parent-->